{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如猪措金山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楞嚴經云：見則同於龜毛兔角"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二智，真俗二智也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無境牽心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即止"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寂而常照清行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真如"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方便"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止觀雙運"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "定慧雙顯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照止名觀，照觀名止。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "緣于真如實"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指前鈍根退者說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子榮曰：如修行須發，修菩薩行須求。大乘正知見人悟達上乘，先了有無二邊之執，方證\n涅槃無相之理，故離所緣之心境也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法華經云：薄德少福人，眾苦所逼迫，入邪\n\n見稠林，若有若無等，依止此諸見，具足六十二。毗婆沙論云：六十二見者，五蘊中各起則見，四五二十三\n世，各二十通，為六十通。身即是神，身與神二見，總為六十二見。曰：於色蘊中，即色是我，離色非我，我中有\n色，色中有我，五蘊中具有此四。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "修真如即修十方佛之心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "王日休云：如星者，謂暗時則現，明時則無。喻眾生愚暗故有有為法，若明悟則\n無也。如翳者，謂眾生自有光明於內，乃為有為法所蔽，如翳障目也。如灯者，謂暗時則用，明時則不用。喻\n眾生愚暗故用有為法，明悟則不用也。如幻者，謂有為法非真寔也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "止門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子榮云：乾城者，即乾達婆城。海上龍蜃化現餘氣，人見樓閣忽爾還無。此破眾生妄\n執五蘊色身為寔。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人我二空觀也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語三昧，此云正定止也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡聖同居"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "然人烏得能化三千世界？蓋假喻耳，乃極言其不可以比也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": "0404001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0404001", "type": "orig", "text": "因緣分第一"}
{"id": null, "n": "0405001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0405001", "type": "orig", "text": "立義分第二"}
{"id": null, "n": "0407001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0407001", "type": "orig", "text": "解釋分第三"}
{"id": null, "n": "0411001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0411001", "type": "orig", "text": "徧疑偏"}
{"id": null, "n": "0412001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0412001", "type": "orig", "text": "非疑是"}
{"id": null, "n": "0416001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0416001", "type": "orig", "text": "一下疑脫義字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421001", "type": "orig", "text": "言染淨法各□相資"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421002", "type": "orig", "text": "闡提不斷性善諸佛不斷性惡"}
{"id": null, "n": "0421003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0421003", "type": "orig", "text": "互相資助"}
{"id": null, "n": "0423001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0423001", "type": "orig", "text": "一無之字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0429001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0429001", "type": "orig", "text": "虗空為喻破眾生着此破空執"}
{"id": null, "n": "0435001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0435001", "type": "orig", "text": "益一作利"}
{"id": null, "n": "0435002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0435002", "type": "orig", "text": "修行信心分第四"}
{"id": null, "n": "0436001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0436001", "type": "orig", "text": "信解行說"}
{"id": null, "n": "0440001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0440001", "type": "orig", "text": "邊疑造"}
{"id": null, "n": "0441001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0441001", "type": "orig", "text": "如字疑剩"}
{"id": null, "n": "0442001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0442001", "type": "orig", "text": "勸修利益分第五"}
